Package: BiocAzul
Title: Programmatic Access to the Azul API
Version: 0.99.35
Date: 2026-04-27
Authors@R: c(
    person("Marcel", "Ramos", , "marcel.ramos@sph.cuny.edu", c("aut", "cre"),
